BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 614 Tm (and its date in the outcomes extract. The teams worked on removals and owner assignments in parallel.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 595.5 Tm (Each platform team completed the owner assignment briefing before assigning any owner.) Tj ET
